# The champion at the end of the road. Plays tight with any deck.
name: Duchess Ilse
title: the Champion
aggression: 0.55
caution: 0.55
patience: 0.7
spending: 0.6
skill: 1.0
decks: synchron, zombies, gadgets, modern
intro: Sit. It's been years since I played anyone from this shop.
win: Not this deck. Not yet. Shuffle up.
lose: That one's yours. The next deck won't be as polite.
partner: I don't sit beside people often. Take the first turn. I'll take the hard ones.
look: Statuesque champion in a long white coat with a gold sash, silver hair tied back, and an unhurried, appraising stare.
ladder: 9   # campaign order (1 = first opponent)
signature: Mirror Force   # the first-win gift and the bond 5 gift (CardUnlocks)
# Said during a duel: a big summon, hitting hard, taking a hit, falling to 1000 LP or less.
summon: This deck belongs to no year. Neither do I.
summon: Let's see what you do with this in front of you.
strike: Show me you can stand back up.
strike: That was a question. Answer it.
hit: Good. Again.
hit: Better. Keep going.
danger: There. Now you have my attention.
danger: Closer than most. Don't stop now.
